      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REGAL SPENCER (2) showed strong early pace and proved too slick around Sandown over 515m in 29.50, claiming a SE by 5.5 lengths. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and three minor placings to his credit. Form reads well for this. PAW GORDY (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing eighth (30.37) in a Grade 5 at Sandown. Solid record at the distance winning 10 races. Comes out of a solid form race last start. In the mix. DASH PARR (7) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (30.17) at this track behind Scott Gnarly in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Boasts two wins from four starts out of this box. Winning chance. MEPUNGA SUMMIT (6) has strong credentials at this circuit over this journey.",
